<title>THAILAND: Berli Jucker first quarter net rises.</title>
<headline>Berli Jucker first quarter net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     2.66	 vs		2.30</p>
<p>    Net		    153.87	 vs	    132.63</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. Berli Jucker Plc is a diversified consumer products group.</p>
